    "analysis": "IMS Toucan is a research-grade PyTorch toolkit for training and running text-to-speech synthesis across more than 7000 languages, developed at the University of Stuttgart. It provides inference interfaces for controllable/cloned voices, GAN-based controllability, an aligner, vocoder (HiFiGAN/BigVGAN), and full training/finetuning pipelines, with pretrained models and datasets published on Hugging Face. Targets speech researchers and developers who need multilingual or low-resource-language TTS rather than a plug-and-play consumer app.",
